      "abstract": "<p>This protocol describes immunocytochemistry for characterisation of differentiated human iPSC-derived cortical cells. Cells are stained with microtubule-associated protein 2 (MAP2) as a general neuronal marker, COUP-TF-interacting protein 2 (CTIP2) to identify layer V cortical neurons, and T-box brain protein 1 (TBR1) to identify deep-layer V/VI cortical neurons. The protocol uses CytoFix/CytoPerm fixation and permeabilisation, followed by primary antibody incubation, fluorescent secondary antibody incubation, Hoechst nuclear counterstaining, washing, plate sealing and storage at 4 \u00b0C in the dark until imaging.</p>",
